      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🔑 Key Principles of Client-Server Architecture:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🔑 Key Principles of Client-Server Architecture:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "ak",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "83e7e92160",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 130,
      "y": 684,
      "width": 652,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 21695,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 105387715,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Separation of Concerns:\n   • Client is responsible for User Interface, gestures, and state rendering.\n   • Server is responsible for business validation, persistence, and security.\n2. Statelessness (REST):\n   • Every HTTP request must contain ALL context needed to fulfill it.\n   • Server stores NO session state on disk/RAM between requests (stateless scaling).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Separation of Concerns:\n   • Client is responsible for User Interface, gestures, and state rendering.\n   • Server is responsible for business validation, persistence, and security.\n2. Statelessness (REST):\n   • Every HTTP request must contain ALL context needed to fulfill it.\n   • Server stores NO session state on disk/RAM between requests (stateless scaling).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "al",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "4a6a462c2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 129.5088465412166,
      "y": 786.9073209338144,
      "width": 562,
      "height": 70,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 48460,
      "version": 113,
      "versionNonce": 1882708493,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394481634,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Centralized Security:\n   • Never trust the client! Input must always be sanitized & authorized.\n4. Scalability:\n   • Clients scale independently of backend workers & database replicas.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Centralized Security:\n   • Never trust the client! Input must always be sanitized & authorized.\n4. Scalability:\n   • Clients scale independently of backend workers & database replicas.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "am",
      "autoResize": true
    },
