      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "🎯 Golden Rules of RESTful API URL Design:",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🎯 Golden Rules of RESTful API URL Design:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0a",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "1b210f465c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 706,
      "width": 419,
      "height": 105,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 11907,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 850995459,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Use Nouns, Not Verbs in Paths:\n   ✅ GET /api/v1/orders\n   ❌ GET /api/v1/getOrders or /api/v1/fetch_all_orders\n2. Plural Nouns for Collections:\n   ✅ /users, /products, /articles\n   ❌ /user, /product (inconsistent convention)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Use Nouns, Not Verbs in Paths:\n   ✅ GET /api/v1/orders\n   ❌ GET /api/v1/getOrders or /api/v1/fetch_all_orders\n2. Plural Nouns for Collections:\n   ✅ /users, /products, /articles\n   ❌ /user, /product (inconsistent convention)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0b",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "83d771a1e7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1590,
      "y": 706,
      "width": 471,
      "height": 87,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 14027,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1334582445,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Path Params vs Query Params:\n   • Use Path Params for Identity: /users/42\n   • Use Query Params for Options: /users?role=admin&page=2\n4. Hierarchical Sub-Resources for Relationships:\n   ✅ GET /users/42/orders (Fetch orders belonging to user 42)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Path Params vs Query Params:\n   • Use Path Params for Identity: /users/42\n   • Use Query Params for Options: /users?role=admin&page=2\n4. Hierarchical Sub-Resources for Relationships:\n   ✅ GET /users/42/orders (Fetch orders belonging to user 42)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0c",
      "autoResize": true
    },
