      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• HEADERS = The postal envelope. Addresses, postage stamp (Auth), return address, delivery speed.\n  The postal worker (router / gateway / firewall) inspects headers WITHOUT opening the envelope.\n• BODY = The letter inside. Private business payload intended ONLY for the recipient app logic.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• HEADERS = The postal envelope. Addresses, postage stamp (Auth), return address, delivery speed.\n  The postal worker (router / gateway / firewall) inspects headers WITHOUT opening the envelope.\n• BODY = The letter inside. Private business payload intended ONLY for the recipient app logic.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1t",
      "autoResize": true
    },
