      "text": "🌟 4 Core Superpowers of Schemas:",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "🌟 4 Core Superpowers of Schemas:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2n",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "c648d4f8e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1605,
      "y": 2122,
      "width": 429,
      "height": 243,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 87953,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 748418605,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791394164696,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Strict Contract Enforcement:\n   Guarantees that backend logic only ever executes with\n   clean, validated, type-safe data.\n\n2. Automatic OpenAPI / Swagger Documentation:\n   Frameworks like FastAPI inspect schemas to generate\n   interactive interactive docs at /docs.\n\n3. Security Defense-in-Depth:\n   Blocks Mass Assignment attacks by ignoring undeclared\n   or prohibited attributes (e.g. \"is_admin\": true).\n\n4. Two-Way Serialization:\n   Validates incoming requests AND filters outgoing response\n   data (e.g., automatically hiding password hashes).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Strict Contract Enforcement:\n   Guarantees that backend logic only ever executes with\n   clean, validated, type-safe data.\n\n2. Automatic OpenAPI / Swagger Documentation:\n   Frameworks like FastAPI inspect schemas to generate\n   interactive interactive docs at /docs.\n\n3. Security Defense-in-Depth:\n   Blocks Mass Assignment attacks by ignoring undeclared\n   or prohibited attributes (e.g. \"is_admin\": true).\n\n4. Two-Way Serialization:\n   Validates incoming requests AND filters outgoing response\n   data (e.g., automatically hiding password hashes).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b2o",
      "autoResize": true
    },
