      "text": "• WebSockets: Persistent full-duplex TCP socket\n  Initiated via HTTP 101 Switching Protocols.\n• Webhooks: Reverse API (HTTP POST callbacks)\n  Server sends automated event payload to client URL\n  when a trigger occurs.",
