      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚡ WebSocket Superpowers vs. Challenges:",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "⚡ WebSocket Superpowers vs. Challenges:",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b7T",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ade2f4e855",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1150,
      "y": 4718,
      "width": 833,
      "height": 64,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 45415,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 432601873,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791725283669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Full-Duplex Bi-Directional: Both client and server can transmit data simultaneously without waiting.\n• True Server Push: Server pushes events to clients instantly (0ms latency, eliminates polling).\n• Ultra-Low Overhead: Lightweight framing (2 to 10 bytes header per message) vs ~1000 bytes HTTP headers!\n• State Management: Server must maintain persistent socket connections in memory (requires Redis pub/sub for scaling).",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Full-Duplex Bi-Directional: Both client and server can transmit data simultaneously without waiting.\n• True Server Push: Server pushes events to clients instantly (0ms latency, eliminates polling).\n• Ultra-Low Overhead: Lightweight framing (2 to 10 bytes header per message) vs ~1000 bytes HTTP headers!\n• State Management: Server must maintain persistent socket connections in memory (requires Redis pub/sub for scaling).",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b7U",
      "autoResize": true
    },
