      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791725283669,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Core Law: Standardized interaction patterns across the ENTIRE system.\n• Consistency: If GET /users retrieves users, GET /products works the exact same way.\n• Client Simplicity: Clients only need to learn general HTTP standards (verbs, status codes,\n  headers) rather than custom proprietary protocols.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 10,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Core Law: Standardized interaction patterns across the ENTIRE system.\n• Consistency: If GET /users retrieves users, GET /products works the exact same way.\n• Client Simplicity: Clients only need to learn general HTTP standards (verbs, status codes,\n  headers) rather than custom proprietary protocols.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b8Q",
      "autoResize": true
    },
